            "review_text": "Bảo Hân N\n2 contributions\n0\nVietnamese seafood\nSep 2026 • Friends\nOverall, the restaurant offers a variety of tasty dishes with fresh ingredients and good presentation. The flavors are well-balanced, and the food quality is quite consistent. It is a good choice for a pleasant meal with family or friends.\nWritten October 7, 2026\nMe In Group\nThank you for your honest feedback! We always want Ốc Hẻm By Mẹ Ỉn to be a cozy retreat where you can leave all the workday stress behind and enjoy piping-hot seafood. Thank you for sharing this awesome energy with us. We look forward to welcoming you back again very soon!\nRead more\nWritten October 10, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
